  storyText: "Wraiths\n\nMotorbikes roar out of the canyon. Wraiths - raiders in scrap armor, painted skulls on their masks. They surround you.\n\n1. Fight.\n2. Offer them everything you have.\n3. \"Mirage - their bikes!\""
